# build output
build/
out/
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.dll
*.exe
# never commit game files or dumps
*.ff
*.iwd
dumps/
# node
node_modules/
infra/host-agent/data/
# local
*.log
.vs/
# Third-party CHECKOUTS belong in ZombiesDev\thirdparty, not here (dev-box.md
# rule 9), so this folder is ignored by default...
thirdparty/*
# ...but code we VENDOR under its licence must be committed, or the repo will
# not build on a fresh clone. MinHook is BSD-2-Clause; LICENSE.txt, AUTHORS.txt
# and VENDORED-FROM.txt (the upstream commit) are kept next to the sources.
!thirdparty/minhook/
ZombiesDev/
